# Line endings are LF in the repository whatever the working tree is on.
#
# Without this, an editor or a syncing client rewriting the tree as CRLF
# makes every text file show as wholly modified. That happened on 4
# September 2026: 436 phantom line changes in paper.tex alone, across
# every tracked text file at once, which stopped a pull and would have
# hidden a real change had there been one among them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Declared rather than detected, so a heuristic cannot decide otherwise
# on a file that happens to start with printable bytes.
*.pdf binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
